---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | AKTU Result Without DOB"
  description="Read our terms of service and usage regulations for the student result query utility."
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-black light:bg-white text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600 text-left">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white light:text-ink mb-8 border-b border-canvas-dark-border pb-4">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Last Updated: July 2026
        </p>
        <p>
          By accessing and using this search tool, you agree to comply with the terms and guidelines outlined below.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">1. Permitted Use</h3>
        <p>
          This utility is provided solely to assist students in retrieving academic records from the official AKTU portal without needing a Date of Birth. You agree to use this tool only for legitimate and authorized lookup requests relating to your own record or where you have received explicit student permission.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">2. Rate Limiting & Abuse</h3>
        <p>
          To protect server bandwidth and prevent denial of service (DoS), lookup actions are rate limited to 100 requests per IP address per day. Any attempts to circumvent these limits, automate bulk requests, or reverse-engineer the session-iteration logic are strictly prohibited.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">3. No Affiliation</h3>
        <p>
          You acknowledge that this utility is a third-party developer tool and has **no affiliation** with Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU).
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white light:text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mt-6">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
        <p>
          This service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The developer does not guarantee that the tool will be uninterrupted, error-free, or compatible with future AKTU portal backend design updates.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
